Subject: [PATCH] wip(stabilisation): continuous chart series, local countdown,
 pool-bar labels, estimator throttle

Work in progress, interrupted by session limits. vite build clean,
node --test 63/63. Not yet runtime-verified; useWebSocket.js wave-2 edits
still pending (see HANDOFF.md in the delivery bundle).

Chart: single continuous 1 bar/s store replaced from candleBatch, no reset
at round boundaries, time cursor from server-offset clock, fixed bar
spacing, ROUND ENTRY in autoscale, histogram scaled to the loaded series,
RAF loop idles when converged. Panel: anchored local countdown, labels
outside the clamped fills, Market Flip / estimate fetch throttling,
resume-snapshot hygiene, watchdog floor + ping probe, PWA cache config.

